andle}.command(\"${4:command}\").submit();"}]],"hovers":["**std**\n\nThe C++ standard library module. mcpp stages the same `std` its own build uses, keyed on toolchain × standard × dialect (`docs/30-build-mcpp.md`, 2026.8.2.1+).","**mcpp**\n\nThe mcpp engine interface, bundled in the mcpp binary so it always matches that engine's protocol. The permanent equivalent spelling of `mcpp.core` (SPEC-007 R9.1).","**mcpp.plugins.tool**\n\nThe official general-purpose library (L2), provided by the `plugins-core` feature and built only on the L1 engine interface, e.g. `mcpp.plugins.tool` (SPEC-007 §9).","**mcpp.rules.qt**\n\nOfficial rule packages (L3): code generation and device-language toolchains (SPEC-007 §0, §9).","**mcpp.core**\n\nThe mcpp engine interface (L1). Only grows; a symbol leaves only after six months of deprecation, and a meaning change is a new symbol (SPEC-007 R9.2).","**mcpp::link_lib**\n\nwire `mcpp:link-lib=` · slot `LdFlags` · scope `LinkGlobal` · since protocol 1\n\nSPEC-007: R2.1","**mcpp::cxxflag**\n\nwire `mcpp:cxxflag=` · slot `CxxFlags` · scope `PackagePrivate` · since protocol 1\n\nSPEC-007: R2.1","**mcpp::cflag**\n\nwire `mcpp:cflag=` · slot `CFlags` · scope `PackagePrivate` · since protocol 1\n\nSPEC-007: R2.1","**mcpp::link_flag**\n\nwire `mcpp:link-flag=` · slot `LdFlags` · scope `LinkGlobal` · since protocol 8\n\nSPEC-007: R2.1","**mcpp::action**\n\nwire `mcpp:action=` · slot `Actions` · scope `GraphNode` · since protocol 1\n\nSPEC-007: R1.1, R1.2, R1.3, R2.1, R3.1, R3.2, R3.3, R3.5, R3.7, R3.8, R3.9, R5.1, R5.3, R6.4, R9.2, R9.10"]}
